0..74 Comment "// Two tail lambdas keep their `return`, and the checker refuses each one."
75..77 Comment "//"
78..150 Comment "// The checker reads a bare tail lambda as a returned box only where the"
151..225 Comment "// expected type returns a box of a function. Elsewhere the lambda stays a"
226..274 Comment "// computation, and its body needs the `return`."
275..277 Comment "//"
278..350 Comment "// A box of a computation that is no function has no lambda to read. The"
351..428 Comment "// checker refuses that lambda with `ShapeMismatch`. A definition that states"
429..495 Comment "// no type has no box to read. The checker refuses its lambda with"
496..518 Comment "// `NotSynthesisable`."
519..521 Comment "//"
522..537 Comment "// - see: #6390"
